  "description": "Runs MiniMax-H3 / HyperFlow H3 Flash video+audio generation in-process from\n      .NET: no Python, no ComfyUI, no HTTP hop. The native h3rt library (CUDA)\n      ships inside this package for Windows and Linux.",
